{"candidateAnswer":"Knowing her writing makes a difference","evidence":"[D18:7 | 6:12 pm on 14 August, 2022] Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Really appreciate your kind words. It's knowing that my writing can make a difference that keeps me going, even on tough days. So glad to have this outlet to share my stories and hopefully have an impact. How about you? Anything new since we last talked?","itemId":"urn:uuid:e35616f2-ecd0-5135-941b-97c8ed7a2dcc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e8cae9db7e74fc9e7167034cd7c2bce4f039152ab7aa6aa76a15f38e9c320d8b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What motivates Joanna to keep writing even on tough days?","referenceAnswer":"Knowing that her writing can make a difference","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e8cae9db7e74fc9e7167034cd7c2bce4f039152ab7aa6aa76a15f38e9c320d8b"}}]}